1
00:00:00,187 --> 00:00:02,180
First, he hurt the love of his life.

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:02,640
Then he spent

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,793
the rest of his life protecting her son.

4
00:00:04,793 --> 00:00:06,530
Severus Snape was born a wizard.

5
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:07,640
Young wizards train

6
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,757
at a hidden castle school called Hogwarts.

7
00:00:09,757 --> 00:00:10,760
There, a magic hat sorts

8
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:13,217
students into houses by who they are inside.

9
00:00:13,217 --> 00:00:14,570
Gryffindor takes the brave.

10
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,170
Slytherin takes the ambitious.

11
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,803
The two houses are enemies.

12
00:00:17,803 --> 00:00:20,020
As a lonely boy, Severus met Lily,

13
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,380
a girl who made flowers bloom

14
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,185
in her hand.

15
00:00:22,185 --> 00:00:23,480
But the hat split them:

16
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,689
Lily to Gryffindor, Severus to Slytherin.

17
00:00:25,689 --> 00:00:27,840
There, James Potter, a Gryffindor bully,

18
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,141
humiliated him in public.

19
00:00:29,141 --> 00:00:30,260
Lily defended him.

20
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,420
To prove he didn't need her,

21
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:33,826
he called her a Mudblood, their cruelest slur.

22
00:00:34,189 --> 00:00:36,691
She never forgave him, and later married James.

23
00:00:36,691 --> 00:00:38,140
Severus joined Voldemort,

24
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,898
the most feared dark wizard alive.

25
00:00:39,898 --> 00:00:41,600
He passed his master a prophecy,

26
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,833
then realized it meant Lily's baby son.

27
00:00:44,117 --> 00:00:45,260
He begged Dumbledore,

28
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:47,079
the school's headmaster, to hide her.

29
00:00:47,079 --> 00:00:48,117
It wasn't enough.

30
00:00:48,557 --> 00:00:49,020
So he promised

31
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,697
to protect the boy with her eyes.

32
00:00:50,697 --> 00:00:51,580
But Harry had her eyes

33
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,100
in James Potter's face,

34
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:55,488
so Severus guarded him and tormented him.

35
00:00:55,488 --> 00:00:56,240
That explains it.

36
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,539
It doesn't excuse it.

37
00:00:57,822 --> 00:00:59,270
Asked if he cared for the boy,

38
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:01,340
Severus answered with a silver doe,

39
00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:02,412
a memory of Lily.

40
00:01:02,412 --> 00:01:03,537
After all this time?

41
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:04,816
Always.

42
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:07,400
Dying, he asked Harry for one last thing.

43
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:08,050
Look at me.

44
00:01:08,747 --> 00:01:09,580
Maybe so the last thing

45
00:01:09,580 --> 00:01:11,478
he ever saw was her eyes.
